 "title": "Joining x² to a straight line smoothly",
 "caption": "For f to be differentiable at x = 1 the two pieces must meet (1 = a + b) and have the same slope (2x = 2 gives a = 2). So b = −1 and the line 2x − 1 touches the parabola at (1, 1) without a corner.",
 "alt": "The parabola y = x² on the left and the line y = 2x − 1 on the right, meeting at (1, 1) with the same gradient 2.",
 "description": [
  "For x ≤ 1, f(x) = x²; for x > 1, f(x) = ax + b.",
  "Continuity at 1 needs a + b = 1.",
  "Equal slopes at 1 need a = 2x = 2.",
  "So b = −1 and the pieces join smoothly at (1, 1)."
